sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Event page and favorites
    %% Stories: 10, 11, 49, 50, 51, 52, 53, 54
    %% Description: An artist provides a description and links for the event page, a visitor reads the page, and a user favorites events and artists.
    actor AP as Artist (person)
    actor VI as Visitor
    actor UP as User (person)
    participant AR as Artist
    participant EV as Event
    participant VE as Venue
    participant U as User

    %% covers 50, 51, 52, 54
    AP->>AR: add description and links
    %% covers 11
    VI->>EV: read the event page
    EV->>VE: location
    %% covers 49
    EV->>AR: artist information
    %% covers 53
    UP->>U: favorite event or artist
    U->>EV: favorite event
    U->>AR: favorite artist
    %% covers 10
    UP->>U: view favorites
